        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>Thronebreaker: Bloodlines of Rebellion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every kingdom starts with a betrayal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, your family was slaughtered under the banner of a tyrant king.<br>Now, after years of strategy, deceit, and rebellion—you’ve taken the throne for yourself. But power has a price. As the crown rests heavy on your head, a darker game begins…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗡️ <strong>A New Threat Rises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when peace seems within reach, you’re struck down by an assassination attempt.<br>You survive—but barely. Years have passed.<br>You’re older. Slower. And now… you’re not the only one who bleeds for truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son takes up the mantle. Together, you must uncover who is behind the dagger… and why your reign still threatens the shadows in your kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <i>A rich, grounded medieval visual novel</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <i>Over 100 impactful choices that shape your path</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔀 <i>Multiple endings based on your loyalty, cruelty or mercy</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <i>A dual-timeline narrative: from rebellion to revenge</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <i>Complex characters, political tension, family, betrayal</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <i>Stunning ultra-realistic art and handcrafted scenes</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Your decisions forge your legacy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your bloodline bring peace to the realm—or drown it in civil war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The images not found error you see in the trailer or images does not exist in the game .            1v1 duels shaped by your choices.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">